BUG 1 – Search/Status/Archived Filtering Bug

Problem:
The SQL query had an AND/OR precedence issue.
Same problem exsists in 
db/queries/search_tasks.sql
db/oracle/task_search_package.sql

The old query was interpreted as:

(archived = FALSE AND title matches)
OR
(description matches AND status matches)

Because AND has higher precedence than OR, archived
tasks could appear in search results and the status
filter could be ignored.

Fix:

I added parentheses around the title and description
conditions:

archived = FALSE
AND (title matches OR description matches)
AND (status matches)

I applied the same fix to:
1. TaskRepository.java
2. search_tasks.sql
3. task_search_package.sql

Result:
Archived tasks are excluded and the status filter works
correctly for both title and description searches.